    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eThis G125 \u003cstrong\u003efilament\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003ebulb dimmable\u003c/strong\u003e with \u003cstrong\u003evintage\u003c/strong\u003e style and \u003cstrong\u003eE27\u003c/strong\u003e type cap helps to respect the planet due to its energy savings. Its power of \u003cstrong\u003e8w \u003c/strong\u003eoffers a great illumination because it uses \u003cstrong\u003eLED\u003c/strong\u003e technology. It begins to replace the old light bulbs with those that give a greater result. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe bulb is \u003cstrong\u003edimmable\u003c/strong\u003e by \u003cstrong\u003eTRIAC.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e8W LED Bulb Filament Vintage E27 G125 - Dimmable\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe design of this \u003cstrong\u003ebulb dimmable\u003c/strong\u003e has an opaque \u003cstrong\u003evintage\u003c/strong\u003e glass and golden touches, which make this bulb an ideal product to create atmospheres and environments \"retro\" and original. Your spaces will have a warm and desert effect thanks to its colour temperature of 2200K.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt stands out for being Dimmable, so the \u003cstrong\u003ebulb\u003c/strong\u003e can \u003cstrong\u003eregulate\u003c/strong\u003e its \u003cstrong\u003elight\u003c/strong\u003e intensity between 0-100%, to be able to perform this function it is necessary to acquire a Regulator.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe type of cap is \u003cstrong\u003eE27\u003c/strong\u003e and has a power of \u003cstrong\u003e8W \u003c/strong\u003eso this product may be the best option to recreate ancient times, which would lead to spaces with traditional charm and ancient. If you are a fan of classic products our \u003cstrong\u003efilament\u003c/strong\u003e bulb is what you are looking for.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe use it can have is multiple, from light bulb as its main use, to as a home lamp to give a special combination and authentically nostalgic. Only our online shop offers you a 2 year guarantee for this product.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eApplications for 8W LED Bulb Filament Vintage E27 G125 - Dimmable\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDecorative lighting\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHanging lamps\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIndustrial lights\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDesk or night lamps\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://www.factorled.com/img/cms/Ambientadas/Decoraci%C3%B3n-vintage-bombillas.jpg\" alt=\"8W LED Bulb Filament E27\" width=\"700\" height=\"394\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt FactorLED we ensure that our products have a QUALITY guarantee and offer all the elements necessary for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical data sheet of each \u003cstrong\u003eLED\u003c/strong\u003e product.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
